      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "When the South Florida Railroad arrived in 1883, Seffner became a vital stop between Tampa and Plant City, igniting growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
